#: lib/pev_squad_web/live/about_live/index.ex:186
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "PEV Squad is Indonesia's personal electric vehicle community — speed (racing), adventure (touring and group rides) and freedom (commuting)."
msgstr "PEV Squad adalah komunitas kendaraan listrik pribadi Indonesia — kecepatan (balapan), petualangan (touring dan group ride), dan kebebasan (komuter)."

#: lib/pev_squad_web/live/community_live/index.ex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "PEV Squad is a collective of riders across Indonesia — mostly performance EUC, plus e-bikes and the occasional electric skateboard. Jakarta to Malang, Depok to Banjarnegara. No entry fee, just show up and ride."
msgstr "PEV Squad adalah kumpulan rider di seluruh Indonesia — kebanyakan EUC performa, plus e-bike dan sesekali skateboard listrik. Dari Jakarta sampai Malang, Depok sampai Banjarnegara. Tanpa biaya masuk, cukup datang dan riding."

#: lib/pev_squad_web/live/about_live/index.ex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "PEV Squad is a community of personal electric vehicle riders across Indonesia — EUCs, performance scooters, electric skateboards and e-bikes. We race, we tour, and we commute. And we team up with local communities and brands to put on events and grow the PEV scene nationwide."
msgstr "PEV Squad adalah komunitas pengendara kendaraan listrik pribadi di seluruh Indonesia — EUC, skuter performa, skateboard listrik, dan e-bike. Kami balapan, touring, dan komuter. Kami juga bekerja sama dengan komunitas lokal dan brand untuk mengadakan event dan membesarkan skena PEV secara nasional."

#: lib/pev_squad_web/components/rider_components.ex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "PEV Squad logo"
msgstr "Logo PEV Squad"

#: lib/pev_squad_web/live/about_live/index.ex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "PEVs as everyday transport. Ride to the station, take it with you on public transport, and ride the last mile — no traffic jams, no parking hunt, your own schedule. We want more people to know a PEV is a real way to get to work."
msgstr "PEV sebagai transportasi sehari-hari. Naik ke stasiun, bawa ke transportasi umum, lalu lanjut last mile — bebas macet, nggak perlu cari parkir, jadwal kamu sendiri. Kami ingin makin banyak orang tahu PEV beneran bisa jadi kendaraan ke kantor."

