#: lib/pev_squad_web/components/partner_components.ex:61
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What we do is connect PEV communities across Indonesia, so it's easier to coordinate bigger events like cross-city tours, races and brand collaborations. Together we also have more weight with national brands, and that benefits every community involved."
